      "description": {
        "en": "The YMC6628 is a cordless portable tire inflator with a 150PSI / 10.3Bar maximum pressure, an 11.1V lithium-polymer battery (2000mAh × 3) and a digital pressure gauge that stops automatically at your target value. It doubles as a power bank with emergency LED light and pressure monitoring, charges in 2–3 hours and runs about 25 minutes per charge. CE certified, suitable for compact cars and motorcycles, with OEM/ODM colour customisation available.",
        "zh": "YMC6628 是一款无线便携充气泵，最高压力 150PSI / 10.3Bar，搭载 11.1V 锂聚合物电池（2000mAh × 3）与数显胎压表，达到设定胎压自动停机；同时内置移动电源与应急 LED 照明、支持胎压监测。2–3 小时充满，单次工作约 25 分钟。已通过 CE 认证，适用于轿车与摩托车，支持 OEM/ODM 颜色定制。"
      },
